          "between $10,500 and $19,500"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Depending on your home's total square footage, the slope of the roof, and the specific materials you choose, overall costs can fluctuate from as low as $5,000 for simple, small roofs up to $40,000 or more for premium materials on large estates.",
        "reference_indexes": [
